claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T04:38:08.197Z",pi-agent,"Confirmed exponential ReDoS in ASSIGNMENT_COMMAND regex. The separator between repeated assignment groups is [ \\t]* (zero-or-more), allowing empty matches that create 2^n parse paths. Fix: require [ \\t]+ (one-or-more) between consecutive assignments, matching real shell semantics."
  "2026-09-01T04:48:32.051Z",pi-agent,"Fix applied and pushed. ASSIGNMENT_COMMAND regex reformulated to require [ \\t]+ between consecutive assignments. LITERAL_ASSIGNMENT already used [ \\t]+ and needed no change. Regression test with 40-repetition pathological input passes in <1ms. Revert-check confirmed: with old regex, 24-rep input takes 907ms (fails <100ms threshold), 40-rep hangs. All 6 unresolved review threads on PR #82 resolved (2 CodeQL ReDoS, 1 coderabbitai empty-assignments, 3 greptile scope/depth). Reviewers re-triggered."
  "2026-09-01T04:48:39.156Z",pi-agent,"Fix applied and pushed. ASSIGNMENT_COMMAND regex reformulated to require [ \\t]+ between consecutive assignments. LITERAL_ASSIGNMENT already used [ \\t]+ and needed no change. Regression test with 40-repetition pathological input passes in <1ms. Revert-check confirmed: with old regex, 24-rep input takes 907ms (fails <100ms threshold), 40-rep hangs. All 6 unresolved review threads on PR #82 resolved (2 CodeQL ReDoS, 1 coderabbitai empty-assignments, 3 greptile scope/depth). Reviewers re-triggered. Waiting 15min for re-review."
body: ""
